# Project Scope Guard

This repository is **ensemble-weather-mispricing** — a weather-based prediction market bot. It has nothing to do with crude oil, Polymarket crude contracts, Databento CME CL futures, Black-Scholes call spreads, or the oil delta monitor dashboard.

## If the user pastes anything about:

- Oil delta monitor, crude probability dislocation monitor, CL.c.0
- Databento live / MBP-1 / BBO-1s for crude oil
- Polymarket crude/oil contracts (cl-above-90, etc.)
- Black-Scholes tight call-spread fair value for oil
- Next.js dashboard with Plotly charts for crude vs Poly probability
- Live ingestor sidecar for oil data
- Any file paths under `/Users/tombaxter/oil/oil-delta-monitor/`

**STOP immediately.** Do not execute. Instead, tell the user:

> "This looks like it belongs in the oil delta monitor project, not the weather bot. Wrong chat?"

The oil delta monitor lives at `/Users/tombaxter/oil/oil-delta-monitor/` and is a separate project with its own Cursor workspace.

## This repo's actual domain

- Weather ensemble models (GFS, ECMWF, etc.)
- Kalshi / weather prediction markets
- Temperature / precipitation signals
- City-level weather-based position management
- Signal generation from weather forecast data
